From 4225d4761f98164343e6419f415bd34403289005 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 17 Sep 2026 17:36:14 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Add DPRNT file source and DPRNT-only telemetry provider
 for Mazak Matrix

Planner can now read the controller's DPRNT output either from the existing
TCP port or by tailing a controller-written print file (Mazak Matrix
DPR14 = 4, C:\MC_sdg\print\print.txt) over a UNC share, with an opt-in
truncate-after-read. Telemetry provider DPRNT declares a controller without
MDC/MTConnect so Part identity and MEIMAD events come from DPRNT lines only.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
